    <h2>Don't Be Weird On Here</h2>
    <p>If you use contact forms or any features, don't be a jerk. No illegal stuff, no spam, no trying to hack the site, no posting harmful content. I'll delete it and you'll be blocked.</p>

    <h2>No Guarantees</h2>
