    <h2>Comments (If They Exist)</h2>
    <p>If I ever add comments, you're responsible for what you post. I can delete spam or stuff that's inappropriate.</p>

    <h2>These Terms Might Change</h2>
    <p>I might update this page. The date at the top shows when that happened. If you keep using the site, you accept the new terms.</p>

    <h2>Legal Jurisdiction</h2>
    <p>This site is run from the United States, so U.S. law applies. Any legal disputes would go through U.S. courts.</p>

    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:baldolanded@gmail.com">baldolanded@gmail.com</a></p>

